"date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1393818/000119312526082531/d48618d10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Blackstone is the world's largest alternative asset manager. We seek to deliver compelling returns for institutional and individual investors by strengthening the companies and assets in which we invest. Our more than $1.3 trillion in Total Assets Under Management as of December 31, 2025 include global investment strategies focused on real estate, private equity, infrastructure, life sciences, growth equity, credit, real assets, secondaries and hedge funds.","zh":"黑石是全球最大的另類資產管理公司。我們力求透過強化我們所投資的公司和資產，為機構和個人投資者帶來可觀的回報。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們管理的總資產超過 1.3 兆美元，包括專注於房地產、私募股權、基礎設施、生命科學、成長股權、信貸、實體資產、二級市場和對沖基金的全球投資策略。"},{"en":"Our businesses use a solutions-oriented approach to drive better performance. We believe our scale, diversified business, long record of investment performance, rigorous investment process and strong client relationships position us to continue to perform well in a variety of market conditions, expand our assets under management, and innovate.","zh":"我们的业务采用以解决方案为导向的方法来提高绩效。我們相信，我們的規模、多元化的業務、長期的投資業績記錄、嚴格的投資流程和牢固的客戶關係使我們能夠在各種市場條件下繼續表現良好，擴大我們管理的資產並進行創新。"},{"en":"We invest across asset classes on behalf of our investors, including pension funds, insurance companies and individual investors. Our mission is to fulfill our fiduciary duty by creating long-term value for our investors. We aim to do this by strengthening the companies, real estate assets and other investments in our portfolio, equipping them to thrive in the global economy. To the extent our funds perform well, we can support a better retirement for tens of millions of pensioners, including teachers, nurses and firefighters.","zh":"我們代表投資者（包括退休基金、保險公司和個人投資者）進行跨資產類別的投資。我們的使命是透過為投資者創造長期價值來履行我們的信託義務。我們的目標是透過加強我們投資組合中的公司、房地產資產和其他投資，幫助它們在全球經濟中蓬勃發展來實現這一目標。只要我們的基金表現良好，我們就可以支持數千萬退休金領取者（包括教師、護士和消防員）過上更好的退休生活。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our four business segments are: (a) Real Estate, (b) Private Equity, (c) Credit & Insurance and (d) Multi-Asset Investing. Information about our business segments should be read together with \"Part II. Item 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.\" For more information concerning the revenues and fees we derive from our business segments, see \"—Fee Structure/Incentive Arrangements.\"","zh":"我们的四个业务部门是：(a) 房地产、(b) 私募股权、(c) 信贷和保险以及 (d) 多元资产投资。有關我們業務部門的資訊應與「第二部分第7項管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論與分析」一起閱讀。有关我们从业务部门获得的收入和费用的更多資訊，请参阅“费用结构/激励安排”。"},{"en":"Our Real Estate business is a global leader in real estate investing, with $319.3 billion of Total Assets Under Management as of December 31, 2025. Our Real Estate business operates as one globally integrated business with approximately 785 employees and has investments across the globe, including in the Americas, Europe and Asia. Our real estate investment teams seek to utilize our global expertise and presence to generate attractive risk-adjusted returns for our investors.","zh":"我們的房地產業務是房地產投資領域的全球領導者，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，管理的總資產為 3,193 億美元。我們的房地產業務作為一個全球一體化企業運營，擁有約 785 名員工，並在全球範圍內進行投資，包括美洲、歐洲和亞洲。我們的房地產投資團隊致力於利用我們的全球專業知識和影響力，為投資者創造有吸引力的風險調整回報。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Investment Advice","val":8075601000,"zh":"投資建議"},{"name":"Investment Performance","val":978202000,"zh":"投資表現"}],"total":14450265000}},"peers":["KKR","BLK","MS","GS","APO"]}}